  "description": "RURTUU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H112 Eu4 O22,2(C1 H1 Cl3),C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.769-3.929 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.68-111.53°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150H112Eu4O22·2CHCl3·C6H14. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
